// Q-034 `state reply = ""` says "expected end of statement, found `reply`" instead of that `reply` is a keyword
// mode: check
// open-when: expected end of statement, found `reply`
// fixed-when: keyword
// From FEEDBACK3.md §6 (found on 896e758). `fn reply()` already says it is a keyword (Q-008's fix).

component Room() {
    state reply = ""
    <p>{reply}</p>
}
